# prompt: short energy beam burst
# tags: beam, energy, burst, scifi
# A beam is the one sci-fi weapon that holds: the envelope has a 40 ms hold at
# peak, so there is a moment of steady tone between the attack and the decay.
# Without it the same layers read as another zap.
sound "beam burst" 185ms laser
  beam: tone saw ~880Hz[440..1800] >> bp ~2200Hz[1000..4500] Q6 | gain 0.38 attack 6ms hold 40ms decay 120ms
  edge: noise white >> hp ~5000Hz[2500..9000] | gain 0.22 decay 60ms
  body: sub ~90Hz[45..160] | gain 0.2 decay 120ms
